include SECURITY.md
# setuptools puts tests/test*.py into an sdist by itself, and nothing else the
# tests read from the checkout (tests/__init__.py, the workflow file): list it,
# so the tests can be run from the sdist.
recursive-include tests *.py
recursive-include workflows *.json
include CHANGELOG.md
# the Claude Code plugin and the Actions example, which the tests read
graft plugins
graft examples
graft .claude-plugin
